# Correct the clinical bottom line while preserving historical draft critique text as historical.
cfield('hcc','32615109','bottom_line','XXL randomized 45 selected responders after downstaging, comparing transplantation with nontransplant treatment. Published five-year OS was 77.5% versus 31.2%, HR 0.32 (95% CI 0.11–0.92). The local submitted draft differs; early closure, selection before randomization and older comparators limit generalization. The published abstract verifies this estimate; the final full report remains an access gap.','B-030',src)
