replace('Neither improved overall survival — EPOCH gave 14.0 versus 14.4 months with grade 3 or worse events in 68% and three treatment-related deaths, and the DEBIRI survival figure comes from 74 patients against an obsolete comparator — and ASCO does not recommend SIRT routinely at all.','EPOCH did not demonstrate OS benefit (14.0 versus 14.4 months), with grade ≥3 events in 68% and three possibly related deaths. The small DEBIRI trial reported OS 22 versus 15 months (P=.031), but its older comparator and reporting limitations restrict application. These results do not establish routine superiority to current systemic treatment; ASCO does not recommend SIRT routinely.','MB035',src,'crlm')
