replace('The only prospective three-way comparison is still enrolling and its drug-eluting-bead arm closed for severe complications.','RETNET reported randomized TAE-versus-cTACE results at NANETS 2025 without a significant hepatic-PFS difference; this does not establish equivalence. Its drug-eluting-bead arm had closed after an early safety signal.','MB067',src,'nelm')
