replace('Is where the closure of RETNET’s drug-eluting-bead arm is reported, the trial’s only practice-changing result so far.','Reports the RETNET DEB-arm safety closure; the later NANETS 2025 conference results separately address TAE versus cTACE.','MB067',src,'nelm')
qfield('nelm','NELM-D12','proposal','Attribute RETNET efficacy results to the 2025 NANETS conference abstract/poster, not the 2018 protocol. Retain conference status and endpoint definitions, remove unsupported medians and do not infer equivalence from nonsignificance. Name an owner for source-version updates across the shared matrix.','MB067',src)
